Forked project: jhaals/yopass
Original authors: jhaals and Yopass contributors
License: Apache License 2.0
Fork purpose: zero-knowledge secret sharing with a transparent UI that lets
  end users SEE the encryption happen in their browser (red key box + green
  ciphertext box), to combat user distrust of "encrypted" services.
Modifications:
  - Rebranded: Yopass -> one-pass
  - Domain: https://one-pass.ohoooho.com
  - Default language: zh-CN (Chinese); English retained as fallback
  - New /about page with hard evidence the server cannot see plaintext
  - Created 4-step encrypt UI (key + ciphertext visible BEFORE submit)
  - Created 2-step decrypt UI (ciphertext + key visible BEFORE decrypt)
  - Added zero-knowledge promise + residual-risk disclosure
  - Removed: file upload, requests, receipts, premium features
  - Deployment: static binary + systemd (no Docker)
